window.products.push({"id":1067079,"name":"simpletome ONE Hand Simply Tear Paper Towel Holder Under Cabinet Wall Mount Adhesive or Drilling Stainless Steel Aluminum Alloy ABS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418p3XqPeVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ONE HANDED SIMPLY-TEAR FUNCTION : simpletome Paper Towel Holder Tension Rod is the NEWEST Patented Structure for ONE HANDED TEAR Function. The Telescopic Spring in the Rod Prevents Unraveling and Provides just Enough Resistance to Tear Off One/Multiple Sheets at a Time with Just One Hand. This Function Is Very Helpful When Busy Cooking. It Is The Home Must Haves Kitchen Accessories and New Home Essentials. PERFECT FOR 11\"/28CM LARGE PAPER ROLL : The Size of rv Paper Towel Holder is 12.2 X 4.72 X 2.56 Inch (31*12*6.5cm), Perfect for 11inch/28cm Paper Rolls, The Expansion Range of Spring is 0.78inch/2cm. The Supported Maximum Thickness of Paper Rolls Under 2.76inch/7cm. Recommended Brands Such As Kirkland, Bounty, Sparkle, Presto! OR Other Brands Paper Towel Rolls Which Length 10.5-11\"/26-28cm. EASY ADHESIVE OR DRILLING INSTALLATION : The Package of Paper Towel Holder Wall Mount/Self Adhesive Include Strong Back Ahesive Tape and Two Sets Different Lengths Screws (the Short Screws are Suitable for Cabinet and The Long Screws for Wall Horizontal Drilling Installation), You Can Choose The Proper Installation Way Depend On The Place You Want To Install. Both Installation Methods Are Very Stable. STRONG AND LIGHTWEIGHT ALUMINUM ALLOY : The Under Counter Paper Towel Holder Made from 5 MM Thickened Aviation Aluminum Alloy Base Plate with Stainless Steel Bold Rod and ABS Quality Accessories, Can Last for Years. Allows for a Quick and Easy Roll Change. Looks Very Good, Modern Fashionable and Attractive. Choose simple-to-me, Choose a Simple Life to Yourself. 5 YEARS WARRANTY. IMPORTANT TIPS FOR ADHESIVE INSTALLATION : ① Please Do Not Use It On Uneven Or Powdery Surface. ② Please Press It Hardly About 15-30 Seconds When Installation, Recommended To Leave It Alone At Least 12-24 Hours Before Using. ③ For Some Wall Surface Which Is Hardly To Use Adhesive Tape, You Can Choose Drilling To Install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418p3XqPeVL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"simpletome","source_asin":"B0B9XXVR18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XXVR18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XXVR18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1067080,"name":"VavoStocks Furniture Felt Pads, 10 Piece Furniture Pads 20 * 20 cm Premium Felt Non-Slip Self Adhesive Floor Protectors Pads for Furniture Sofa Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814tc1qJUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality Thick Pads The furniture pads is made of high-quality felt, which is thick and soft, which can prevent floor scratching. The adhesive has very good adhesion and can be glued to any furniture, Long lasting and durable, does job well. Keeping Scratches Away Are you still worrying about floor scratches caused by moving furniture The furniture leg pads is a good solution. The pads forms a firm protective layer between the furniture and the floor, which can well avoid scratches. Easy-to-cut Pads A single-shaped protective pads for furniture is difficult to apply to a wide variety of furniture. According to your furniture, this self adhesive felt pads is cut into the required shape. Can be widely used in beds, tables, chairs, stools, sofas, etc. Great value, high quality. Easy to install First, cut the wood protector pads into the shape you need, and then clean the dust on the surface of the furniture, remove the outer skin of the felt pads, and then stick it firmly. Extra furniture felt pads can be easily kept in the bag. Reduce Noise This self adhesive felt pads forms an effective protective layer between the furniture and the wooden floor. Due to its soft material, the pads can play a buffer effect, thereby reducing noise and creating a comfortable environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814tc1qJUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VavoStocks","source_asin":"B08PTVVN2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PTVVN2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PTVVN2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
