window.products.push({"id":1067084,"name":"Autoark Solid Sturdy Stainless Steel Stackable Measuring Cups Set to Measure Dry and Liquid Ingredients with Soft Handles,for Kitchen Cooking Baking,5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qqxFo9X2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From Autoark Measuring Cup Set Welcome to choose the Ipow measuring cups for everyone cooks in the kitchen, This five piece measuring spoon set with colorful handles are sure to brighten any kitchen.Which are dispensable kitchen tools. More advantages: This measuring cups set is a mixuture of beauty design and strong functionality. Measuring cups construction of the heaviest stainless steel.Its total weight is 13.5 Ounce,other's is just 8 Ounce.Ours are more solider and sturdy.So it never melt, chip, warp, or break like plastic models. The measuring spoon handles is more colorful,especially because of large and soft material.It ergonomically designed for maximum comfort. The real and unique cooking tools While there are many cooking sets on the market,most are miniaturized or Singular color or singular size. But Autoark measuring cups are pride for functional,high-quality and colorful.Set of five comes in 1/8,1/4-,1/3-,1/2-,and 1-cup increments with easy to read measurements on each handle,which can meet all kinds of needs.Soft,non-slip handles offer comfortable feel.The design of hold in handle allow for hanging,and compact shape is more easy to storage when not in use. Versatile Use: Whether for a birthday,holiday,or just because cook every day.The cooking sets make a perfect present for any tasty meal.These stainless-steel cups are essential for bakers,chief,Spoon,measuring of flour,sugar and other ingredients alike.So You won't have to worry about capacity measurement decals wearing off over time. hope you and your family can enjoy your own journey of cooking,discovery,and fun.Warm Tip: Use warm vinegar instead of the detergent solution to loosen the label and its adhesive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qqxFo9X2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUTOARK","source_asin":"B01GKXAL4U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GKXAL4U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GKXAL4U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1067085,"name":"Idle Sleep 12 Inch Gel Foam Mattress (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbc-hzULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RAPID RESPONSE TECHNOLOGY Idle foam mattresses benefit from advanced thermal neutrality, guaranteeing your body a comfortable contoured support which rapidly returns to form when you move, meaning no more sink holes across your mattress. COOLING BUOYANCY Idle Cooling Buoyancy Foam is made without visco elastic chemicals so Idle stays cooler than memory foam with better pressure relief. CERTIPUR-US CERTIFIED FOAM Idle is made with only CertiPUR-US️ certified foams meaning no ozone depleters, PBDE’s, TDCPP, mercury or lead. Sleep Idle and soundly knowing your bed is made with certified CertiPUR-US️ foam. A revolution in memory foam This is memory foam but not how you knew it. No more sink holes or night time sweats. We’ve taken the best in foam comfort, and updated them with our unique quality and gel cooling technology layers. Brilliant performance without compromise. Unrivaled Plushness Unlike most brands whose mattresses only offer 10″ of support, Idle leads the pack with a minimum of 12″ across their memory foam range, which provides a level of comfort and feeling of plushness not avalable anywhere else. You will feel like you are floating on clouds. Comfort by Nature A good mattress should feel nice on the skin so we only use Tier-1 450GSM+ fibre coverings and have placed it on a higher weighted and quality foam. Other brands make excessive profits from using lower grade and uncomfortable textile substitutes. Unbeatable 18-Month Trial Try Idle in your home with the world’s longest 100% risk free sleep trial. Warranty Without End Our warranty lasts a lifetime and even covers body impressions. Easy & Free Returns If things don’t work out, returns are easy and free. No questions asked. Durability To add extra durability to our mattresses we use a 2.4lb base compared the industry standard of 1.8lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbc-hzULL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Idle Sleep","source_asin":"B08KJP61YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KJP61YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KJP61YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1067086,"name":"PANWA Sticky Rice Aluminum Cook Pot from Thailand - Genuine Replacement Pot for Traditional Steamer Crock, Family Size 8.67 Inch Standard Diameter (22","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YsJ580pZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you ever had a taste of traditional Thai sticky rice, you know instantly that this is a treat you will want to learn how to make for your family and friends. With the high quality “Crocodile” Aluminum sticky rice cooking pot, it’s time to transform your conventional recipe to amazing and authentic cuisine. Sticky rice, called “Kow neow” in the Thai language, is especially popular among the people from the north and northeastern areas of Thailand. Besides being household appliance, these pots also function as kitchen adornments. The more rugged they look, the more experienced the cook, and it’s viewed as a prized badge of honor that becomes both a keepsake and a pass down item to the next generation of Thai countryside Chefs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YsJ580pZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PANWA","source_asin":"B08F56K1SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F56K1SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F56K1SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
