window.products.push({"id":1067152,"name":"Mocoosy 18 PCS Unicorn Party Favor Bags for Kids Unicorn Birthday Party, Unicorn Goodie Candy Treat Paper Gift Bags with Handles for Girls Boys Rainbo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HPghvBdqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kraft Paper, Cardstock Unicorn Party Supplies: Come with 18 pieces of unicorn party favor bags in 6 different styles, 3 pieces for each style. The size of each goodie bag for kids' birthday is 6.3 x 3.1 x 8.46 inches. Big size for holding plenty of party favors(candies, biscuits, toys, snacks, etc). The unicorn print is so cute, which is the best gift for birthday girls or boys. Double Sided Designs: Our unicorn party bags have double-sided designs with 6 cute glitter patterns which make the candy bag more unique. The unicorn face is printed on the front and a rainbow wavy pattern is on the back. Bright colors will make them popular with the kids. Kids will enjoy picking out their favorite color or unicorn in different designs. Reusable & Sturdy: Our unicorn gift bags with handles are made of high-quality and recyclable kraft paper, environmentally friendly, easy to stand and light to carry. Thicker than regular party paper bags, stable and not easy to break, no smell, no fading, can be able to fold and store for the next use. Perfect size and effect to upgrade the value of gifts. Perfect For Party Favors: Unicorns will never grow old. These unicorn treat bags are a great buy for party favors. The vivid colors and patterns were popular with the kids. Kids will absolutely love receiving these unicorn goodie bags and be delighted to find out what awaits inside. Exquisite and convenient gift packaging bags bring a lot of fun to your party. Wide Applications: Our unicorn theme bags will be ideal for kids goody bags at any theme party. They are suitable as birthday gift bags, candy bags, party favor bags, treat bags etc. It can be used in unicorn theme birthday parties, baby showers, school classroom handouts, camping, holidays, Christmas, etc. Creating a cheerful atmosphere for you and your guests.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HPghvBdqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mocoosy","source_asin":"B09WRF3Z4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WRF3Z4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WRF3Z4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
