window.products.push({"id":1067155,"name":"St. Patrick's Day Gnome Decorations Handmade Plush Elf Irish Nisse Tiered Tray Decorations Wall Floating Shelf Decor Lucky Ornaments Tomte Green Shamr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYLI8ao+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀Luck and Gnomes: Gnome, known as a tomte or nisse, is a symbol of luck. They can dispel misfortune and bring good luck to the family. They are very suitable for St Patrick’s Day! Bring the festive atmosphere to your family and friends by placing the gnome in living room, such as desk, table, sofa, bookcase, wall shelf, floating shelf, dining table, and bed! 🍀High-quality Handmade: The plush gnome dolls, made of high-quality wool felt, are 100% hand sewn. These gnomes have a wonderful design! One of the gnome holds a shiny clover in his hands and the other is holds a mini Irish flag. There are shiny shamrocks on both of their hats too. Bring these cute gnome to your home! The quality never let you down! 🍀Perfect Size: When sitting on the table, the height of these two gnomes respectively are up to 10” and 7” (if plus legs, total height are up to 17”). It’s a nice size compared to other gnome. Sandbags are added to the bottom of the gnomes to make them sit very stable. 🍀St. Patrick’s Day Decoration: This Irish leprechaun gnome ornaments is nice for decorating wall shelf table, beds, stairs, fireplaces, home, halls, and so on, it can make the whole house full of joyful festive atmosphere, you can easily take this lucky to your friends, family's, neighbors and children. The adorable gnomes are traditional and perfect for spreading the holiday spirit. 🍀Holiday Gift: This gnome is a perfect gift for St. Patrick's Day. It adds to the festive atmosphere and conveys the meaning of luck to the family or friends who receive the gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYLI8ao+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XTOWEN","source_asin":"B09M7FTV7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M7FTV7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M7FTV7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
