window.products.push({"id":1067269,"name":"Droata Helix Pillar Candle - Ivory Beeswax Blend - 6 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3ovNBPUL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Through a delicate balance of mathematical relationships, the helix is a beautiful example of form following function, forming the foundation for the shape of the very building blocks of life. The Helix Pillar Candle is a waxen manifestation of these principles. Our beeswax is mixed with a proprietary blend of paraffin and soy wax to create clean-burning, long-lasting flames. Combined with a natural cotton wick, the graceful curves of this candle are sure to bring a sensuous energy to any space.Each of our candles is handcrafted in our chandlery and apiary, and as such, the dimensions may vary by up to ¼” from those listed. The 3\" width listed is the diameter measured at its widest point. Exact color may also vary slightly according to different monitors, changes in bee populations, and the availability of pollen and production of propolis. Remember, a candle has power both to banish shadows and to cast them. Burn it wisely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3ovNBPUL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07NS6Y47W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NS6Y47W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NS6Y47W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
