window.products.push({"id":1067774,"name":"Motivational Wall Decal | 'Forget The Mistake Remember The Lesson' | Inspirational Quote Removable Vinyl Decal for Home, Bedroom, Office, or Dorm | Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eVEj0RnpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"YOUR DESIGN: This motivational quote is a good reminder to learn form mistakes and to not let them define you. This design is perfect for any classroom, family room, or office. STRESS FREE - Our wall stickers are one of the easiest, stylish and most cost-friendly ways to decorate your space. They'll easily apply to walls, windows, mirrors, doors, tables and many other smooth surfaces QUALITY: Your wall decal is proudly MADE IN THE USA and cut by out Team of stay at home moms from High Quality Oracal 631 Series vinyl for indoor use and made with a removable, residue-free adhesive to ensure the surface you adhere them to remains pristine if you decide to remove it in the future SIZE OPTIONS: We offer a range of sizes to complement any area of your home, office, church, school, etc. Small, medium, large, extra-large, and giant Sizes COLOR OPTIONS: Choose from a variety of 25 different color options: Black, White, Brown, Beige, Charcoal Gray, Light Gray, Metallic Silver, Metallic Gold, Dark Red, Red, Pink, Soft Pink, Orange, Yellow, Dark Green, Green, Lime Green, Mint, Turquoise (Teal), Dark Blue (Navy), Brilliant Blue, Powder Blue, Purple, and Lilac","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eVEj0RnpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CustomVinylDecor","source_asin":"B093JZBBGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093JZBBGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093JZBBGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1067775,"name":"EcoPeaceful 8 Silicone Mason Jar Lids w/Utensil Holder (for Spoon or Straw) - PUSH-ON Mason Jar Caps - One Size For Wide & Regular Mouth Mason Jar Top","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813VEzcs8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hi I'm Lena, CEO of Eco Peaceful, LLC. I am a passionate vegan environmentalist who believes that manufacturers should be responsible to produce quality products that last a very long time & package their products in an eco-friendly manner so wild animals can live their lives in their natural environment  After watching Plastic Planet and other documentaries I was so shocked what plastic does to the animals and humans, so I decided to change my lifestyle: I started to grow my food to reduce plastic consumption and started my EcoPeaceful zero-waste business in 2012 to manufacture organic, natural and non-toxic products that are packaged plastic-free and in the most Eco-friendly way possible.  If you make your own food & drinks (tea/coffee, smoothies...) then mason jars are an important part of your daily life. What you may not know is that the common canning metal lids have a PVC/vinyl coating with a plastisol/PVC seal gasket. That has always bothered me since the liquid in the jar vapors and drops back down into my drink or food. I became especially concerned when I saw that the vinyl coating was flaking off just from putting vinegar in a glass jar (it was not even touching the coated metal lid). I was inspired to look for alternative lid solutions.  Plastic caps lids are also not a good option since the plastic degrade and shed microplastics & release toxic chemicals; BPA-free is rarely truly BPA-free and/or replaced with worse chemical(s). Plastic lids are breakable, heat-sensitive (can't be boil to sanitize); and the most important for me - pollutes the environment and harms/kills wildlife. Silicone are much safer for health and environment, and very durable, so no need constantly buying and throwing away metal canning lids or plastic lids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813VEzcs8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoPeaceful","source_asin":"B097VTPBM4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1067775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097VTPBM4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097VTPBM4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
